; Native Lim adaptation of the pinned rational Frey definitions and b2/b4 proofs.
; Exact rational Frey coefficient formulas at pinned
; Def_FLTPrelim_FreyPackage.lean:83-95. The coefficients are1,
; (B-1-A)/4,0,(-A)*B/16,0 with A=a^p and B=b^p.
; Prove b2,b4,b6 and coefficient nonvanishing using actual fraction
; cancellation and signed power witnesses. The discriminant identity
; and ellipticity are subsequent obligations, not assumptions here.
